{"title":"Dinner Lady E Liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the exquisite range of Dinner Lady E-Liquid, where tradition meets innovation in every bottle. Our \"Core by Dinner Lady\" collection redefines your vaping experience with meticulously blended flavors that cater to every palate. Each bottle of Dinner Lady Freebase and Core E-Liquid is a testament to our commitment to quality, flavor, and satisfaction.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-strawberry-apple","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Strawberry Apple","description":"\u003cp\u003eStrawberry Apple by Core Dinner lady is a succulent green and red apples, blended with rich, full bodied candy Strawberries.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-liquid\" title=\"E liquids\"\u003eE Liquid\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Strawberry, Apple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761727807543,"sku":"69d25fd80e13c","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761727840311,"sku":"69d25fd8a07b8","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Core_Strawberry_Apple_120ml.png?v=1751837285"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-grape-wine","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Grape Wine","description":"\u003cp\u003eGrape Vine by Core Dinner lady Marvin called this out in 1968. ‘’I heard it through the grape-vine’’. Purple and Red grapes, sweet, slightly sour, and punchy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Grape\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761727873079,"sku":"69d25fd80af25","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761727905847,"sku":"69d25fd896c54","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-GRAPE-VINE-120ML.jpg?v=1751837287"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-honeydew-lemonade","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Honeydew Lemonade","description":"\u003cp\u003eHoneydew Melonade by Core Dinner lady is a subtle, sweet \u0026amp; refreshingly juicy honey melon vape, layered within our secret home-made lemonade on crushed ice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Honeydew, Melon, Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761727938615,"sku":"69d25fd80b60d","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761727971383,"sku":"69d25fd89cf2e","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-HONEYDEW-MELONADE-120ML.jpg?v=1751837289"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-pink-lemonade","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Pink Lemonade","description":"\u003cp\u003ePink Lemonade by Core Dinner lady is a classic summer taste. A fusion of rich, sweet, and tart red berries, blended with cloudy lemonade and crushed ice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Berries, Lemonade, Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761728004151,"sku":"69d25fd80d219","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761728036919,"sku":"69d25fd8a6c50","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-PINK-LEMONADE-120ML.jpg?v=1751837292"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-tropic-mango-chill","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Tropic Mango Chill","description":"\u003cp\u003eTropic Mango Chill by Core Dinner lady is a deliciously chilled tropical fusion, Sweet and juicy Mango’s fused with a fresh and cooling hit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Mango, Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761728069687,"sku":"69d25fd80dbe4","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761728102455,"sku":"69d25fd897269","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-TROPIC-MANGO-CHILL-120ML.jpg?v=1751837294"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-tropic-thunder","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Tropic Thunder","description":"\u003cp\u003eTropic Thunder by Core Dinner lady is an electric fusion of worldly tropical fruits! Top notes of rich Pineapple, Mango \u0026amp; Guava, to mid notes of crisp Apple, Citric fruits, and sweet passion fruits!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Pineapple, Mango, Guava\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761728135223,"sku":"69d2603726440","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761728167991,"sku":"69d26037b4068","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-TROPIC-THUNDER-120ML.jpg?v=1751837296"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-vanilla-custard","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Vanilla Custard","description":"\u003cp\u003eVanilla Custard by Core Dinner lady is a sweet, velvety, rich, and creamy custard blend.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-liquid\" title=\"vape e liquid\"\u003eE Liquid\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Vanilla, Custard, Cream\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761728200759,"sku":"69d25fdd10b20","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_