6amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: \u003cem\u003e120ml\u003c\/em\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Vanilla, Tobacco\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761728331831,"sku":"69d2603c0d168","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761728364599,"sku":"69d2603ca6938","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-VANILLA-TOBACCO-120ML.jpg?v=1751837303"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-e-liquid-strawberry-macaroon","title":"Dinner Lady E Liquid - Strawberry Macaroon","description":"\u003cp\u003eA strawberry macaroon with just the right amount of sweetness combined with cream, almonds and coconut to fulfil your heart's desire. The Dinner Lady Premium E liquid range.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlend : 70\/30\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eContent : 60ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrength : 3mg | 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDinner Lady from the UK has won numerous prestigious international awards and has products flying off the shelves in 96 countries. You can also buy\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"dinner lady e liquids\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/dinner-lady-e-liquid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003edinner lady e liquids\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003efrom us!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"0MG","offer_id":41914947633207,"sku":"Dinner Lady - Strawberry Macaroon - 0 Mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41914947665975,"sku":"Dinner Lady - Strawberry Macaroon - 3 Mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41914947698743,"sku":"Dinner Lady - Strawberry Macaroon - 6 Mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Dinner-lady-strawberry-macaroon.jpg?v=1759875133"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-ice-e-liquid-black-orange-crush","title":"Dinner Lady E Liquid - Black Orange Crush Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eBlack Orange Crush shortfill e-liquid by Dinner Lady is a rich fruity blend with a cool, citrus undertone. A mixture of rich, dark blackcurrant is combined with a juicy orange taste before a sharp ice kick finishes off the vape for a layered yet balanced flavour.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlend : 70\/30\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eContent : 60ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrength : 3mg | 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDinner Lady from the UK has won numerous prestigious international awards and has products flying off the shelves in 96 countries. You can also buy more\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-liquid\" title=\"vape liquid\" target=\"_blank\"\u003evape liquid\u003c\/a\u003e from us!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"0MG","offer_id":41914947764279,"sku":"Dinner Lady - Black Orange Crush Ice - 0 Mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41914947797047,"sku":"Dinner Lady - Black Orange Crush Ice - 3 Mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41914947829815,"sku":"Dinner Lady - Black Orange Crush Ice - 6 Mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Dinner_Lady_Black_Orange_Crush_60ml_3mg.jpg?v=1759875134"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-ice-e-liquid-sun-tan-mango","title":"Dinner Lady Ice E Liquid - Sun Tan Mango Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe inhale is characterised by a juicy tropical mango flavour, that's paired with a sweet honey. On exhale, a smooth ice creates a cool finish.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlend : 70\/30\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eContent : 60ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrength : 3mg | 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDinner Lady from the UK has won numerous prestigious international awards and has products flying off the shelves in 96 countries. You can also buy\u003cspan\u003e more \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"vape e liquids\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-liquid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003evape e liquids\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003efrom us!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"0MG","offer_id":41914947960887,"sku":"Dinner Lady - Sun Tan Mango Ice - 0 Mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41914947993655,"sku":"Dinner Lady - Sun Tan Mango Ice - 3 Mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41914948026423,"sku":"Dinner Lady - Sun Tan Mango Ice - 6 Mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/DinnerLady-Ice-SunTanMango.jpg?v=1759875135"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-desserts-e-liquid-lemon-tart","title":"Dinner Lady Desserts E Liquid - Lemon Tart","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis unique brand of e-liquid with nicotine features a taste that reminds you of a sharp lemon curd topped with gooey meringue, all cradled by a thin pastry crust. And like every dessert, this e-juice leaves you excited and wanting more. It's a flavourful choice for your everyday vape juice needs.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlend : 70\/30\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eContent : 60ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrength : 3mg | 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDinner Lady from the UK has won numerous